  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWF Lake Vic Eduprogram2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WWF Lake Vic Eduprogram2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med programmet &#xe4;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla den ekologiska integriteten och h&#xe5;llbarheten i Victoriasj&#xf6;ns avrinningsomr&#xe5;den till f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;n f&#xf6;r dess inv&#xe5;nare och biologiska m&#xe5;ngfald. Programmet avser att anv&#xe4;nda begreppet utbildning f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling (ESD) som ing&#xe5;ngspunkt. Omfattar Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania och Rwanda detta &#xe4;r st&#xf6;det till fas II.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the programme is to secure the ecological integrity and   sustainability of the Lake Victoria catchment for the benefit of its  inhabitants and biological diversity. The programme envisages using   the concept of Education for Sustainable Development (ESD) as the     entry point. Covering Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania and Rwanda this is the  support to Phase II.</narrative>
  </description>
